{"id":"3a19d5715745463a","group":"91","path":"91/91-df-stable-sentence.md","title":"稳定句子","display":"df-stable-sentence — 稳定句子","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Axiomatic Theories of Truth","book_abbrev":"91","label":"91-df-stable-sentence","aliases":["91-df-stable-sentence","91-df-stable"],"display":"df-stable-sentence — 稳定句子","depends_on":["[[91-df-jump-operator]]","[[91-df-strong-kleene]]","[[91-df-truth-value-function]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Axiomatic Theories of Truth"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"91"},{"key":"label","html":"91-df-stable-sentence"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>91-df-stable-sentence</span><span>91-df-stable</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-stable-sentence — 稳定句子"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"ae9eced0b12cbd2a\" href=\"?note=ae9eced0b12cbd2a\" title=\"91-df-jump-operator\">91-df-jump-operator</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"fcfe6f023ac58abf\" href=\"?note=fcfe6f023ac58abf\" title=\"91-df-strong-kleene\">91-df-strong-kleene</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"2bc1263010e83604\" href=\"?note=2bc1263010e83604\" title=\"91-df-truth-value-function\">91-df-truth-value-function</a></span></div>"}],"html":"<h1 id=\"df-stable-sentence-—-稳定句子-$\\mathrm{Stable}$\">df-stable-sentence — 稳定句子 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Stable}\">\\(\\mathrm{Stable}\\)</span></h1>\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"J\">\\(J\\)</span> (跳跃算子)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Fix}_{c}(J)=\\{\\Gamma\\mid J(\\Gamma)=\\Gamma\\land\\operatorname{ConInfo}(\\Gamma)\\}\">\\(\\operatorname{Fix}_{c}(J)=\\{\\Gamma\\mid J(\\Gamma)=\\Gamma\\land\\operatorname{ConInfo}(\\Gamma)\\}\\)</span> (一致固定点类)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"v_\\Gamma:\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_T}\\to\\mathbf 3\">\\(v_\\Gamma:\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_T}\\to\\mathbf 3\\)</span> (固定点 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma\">\\(\\Gamma\\)</span> 诱导的真值函数)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}stable\\text{-}sentence}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Stable}(\\varphi)\\coloneqq\n\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_T}\n\\land\\operatorname{Fix}_{c}(J)\\ne\\varnothing\n\\land\\exists a\\in\\mathbf 3\\;\\forall\\Gamma\\in\\operatorname{Fix}_{c}(J)\\,\n\\bigl(v_\\Gamma(\\varphi)=a\\bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}stable\\text{-}sentence}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Stable}(\\varphi)\\coloneqq\n\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_T}\n\\land\\operatorname{Fix}_{c}(J)\\ne\\varnothing\n\\land\\exists a\\in\\mathbf 3\\;\\forall\\Gamma\\in\\operatorname{Fix}_{c}(J)\\,\n\\bigl(v_\\Gamma(\\varphi)=a\\bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>关键符号：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Stable}\">\\(\\mathrm{Stable}\\)</span> : 稳定句子集</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Stable}(\\varphi)\">\\(\\mathrm{Stable}(\\varphi)\\)</span> : <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi\">\\(\\varphi\\)</span>是稳定句子</li>\n</ul>\n<p>稳定句子在所有一致固定点中保持同一个真值，该值可以是真、假或未定义。\n限制到一致固定点很重要：若把代数格中的真值过剩固定点也算入，标准\n说谎者未必仍保持间隙。</p>\n<p>稳定句子的特征：</p>\n<div class=\"table-scroll\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"表格\"><table><thead>\n<tr>\n<th>类型</th>\n<th>最小固定点</th>\n<th>最大固定点</th>\n<th>稳定性</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>稳定真</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi \\in \\Gamma_{\\mathrm{min}}\">\\(\\varphi \\in \\Gamma_{\\mathrm{min}}\\)</span></td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi \\in \\Gamma_{\\mathrm{max}}\">\\(\\varphi \\in \\Gamma_{\\mathrm{max}}\\)</span></td>\n<td>✓ 稳定</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>稳定假</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\neg \\varphi\">\\(\\neg \\varphi\\)</span> 被判真</td>\n<td>所有固定点均为假</td>\n<td>✓ 稳定</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>稳定间隙</td>\n<td>两侧均未判定</td>\n<td>所有固定点均为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf u\">\\(\\mathbf u\\)</span></td>\n<td>✓ 稳定</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>不稳定</td>\n<td>间隙</td>\n<td>可真可假</td>\n<td>✗ 不稳定</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table></div><p>稳定句子的例子：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>基础语言真句子</strong>：<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\forall x\\;(x = x)\">\\(\\forall x\\;(x = x)\\)</span>是稳定真</li>\n<li><strong>基础语言假句子</strong>：<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"0 = 1\">\\(0 = 1\\)</span>是稳定假</li>\n<li><strong>正公式真句子</strong>：<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T(\\ulcorner \\forall x\\;(x = x) \\urcorner)\">\\(T(\\ulcorner \\forall x\\;(x = x) \\urcorner)\\)</span>是稳定真</li>\n</ul>\n<p>不稳定句子的例子：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>真理陈述者</strong>：<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\tau\">\\(\\tau\\)</span>不稳定（可真可假）</li>\n<li><strong>说谎者</strong>：<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\lambda\">\\(\\lambda\\)</span>&quot;稳定间隙&quot;（始终间隙）</li>\n</ul>\n<p>稳定句子与真理理论的关系：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>稳定并不等于二值确定；说谎者可稳定地取 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf u\">\\(\\mathbf u\\)</span></li>\n<li>只有稳定且值为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf t\">\\(\\mathbf t\\)</span> 或 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf f\">\\(\\mathbf f\\)</span> 的句子才具有相应的确定真值</li>\n<li>稳定句子是真理推理的安全对象</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"df-stable-sentence-—-稳定句子-$\\mathrm{Stable}$","text":"df-stable-sentence — 稳定句子 $\\mathrm{Stable}$","level":1},{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"91-df-jump-operator","status":"resolved","id":"ae9eced0b12cbd2a","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[91-df-jump-operator]]","embed":false},{"target":"91-df-strong-kleene","status":"resolved","id":"fcfe6f023ac58abf","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[91-df-strong-kleene]]","embed":false},{"target":"91-df-truth-value-function","status":"resolved","id":"2bc1263010e83604","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[91-df-truth-value-function]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathrm{Stable}","display":false},{"tex":"J","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Fix}_{c}(J)=\\{\\Gamma\\mid J(\\Gamma)=\\Gamma\\land\\operatorname{ConInfo}(\\Gamma)\\}","display":false},{"tex":"v_\\Gamma:\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_T}\\to\\mathbf 3","display":false},{"tex":"\\Gamma","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}stable\\text{-}sentence}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Stable}(\\varphi)\\coloneqq\n\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_T}\n\\land\\operatorname{Fix}_{c}(J)\\ne\\varnothing\n\\land\\exists a\\in\\mathbf 3\\;\\forall\\Gamma\\in\\operatorname{Fix}_{c}(J)\\,\n\\bigl(v_\\Gamma(\\varphi)=a\\bigr).","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Stable}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Stable}(\\varphi)","display":false},{"tex":"\\varphi","display":false},{"tex":"\\varphi \\in \\Gamma_{\\mathrm{min}}","display":false},{"tex":"\\varphi \\in \\Gamma_{\\mathrm{max}}","display":false},{"tex":"\\neg \\varphi","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbf u","display":false},{"tex":"\\forall x\\;(x = x)","display":false},{"tex":"0 = 1","display":false},{"tex":"T(\\ulcorner \\forall x\\;(x = x) \\urcorner)","display":false},{"tex":"\\tau","display":false},{"tex":"\\lambda","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbf u","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbf t","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbf f","display":false}],"bytes":2347,"backlinks":[{"id":"e9bbbe4420f54ce9","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"6b350e567d372da